  "name": "Bake Oven",
  "description": "An Oven Core: bakes a welded group of subparts set on its bed under a heavy hood. Weld Oven Bed Blocks beside it (the bed is their rectangle, up to 32 x 32 m) and stack Mast Blocks on the bed's four corners: the shortest corner mast sets the clear height under the hood. Loaded from above, by a crane, a Lifter or the physics gun. The hood comes down on whatever is on the bed. Needs power.",
